# Build context is the repo root, so this keeps images small and cache-friendly.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/prisma/generated
**/coverage

# Secrets and local config — supplied as env vars at runtime instead
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/keys/*.pem

.git
.github
docs
*.md
!README.md

# Reference-only apps, never containerised
apps/ant-design-pro-master
apps/web

**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.log
